TizenS3
Unofficial port of Samsung TizenRT to the Espressif ESP32-S3.

This product includes software developed by Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd.
as part of TizenRT (https://github.com/Samsung/TizenRT), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. TizenRT is derived in part from Apache NuttX.

This product includes files derived from Espressif ESP-IDF
(https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, including the ESP32-S3 ROM symbol table, register definitions
and the prebuilt 2nd-stage bootloader. The Xtensa core configuration
headers (core-isa.h, tie.h, tie-asm.h) are Copyright (c) Tensilica Inc. /
Cadence Design Systems and are distributed under their original MIT-style
license, which is retained in each file.

Modifications: ESP32-S3 chip support, TizenS3 board support, console,
flash, GPIO and WS2812 drivers, and fixes to existing TizenRT files, as
listed in tizens3.patch and README.md.

